# Topic rights per account; anything not granted is refused. Each service publishes only
# its own contract topics (see docs/architecture/overview.md) and reads only what it uses.

user physics-engine
topic write sensors/#
topic readwrite status/physics-engine

user plc-controller
topic write alerts/#
topic write plc/events
topic readwrite status/plc-controller

user alert-manager
topic read alerts/#
topic write alarms/changes

user historian
topic read sensors/#
topic read alarms/changes
topic read plc/events
topic read status/+

user api-gateway
topic read plc/events
topic read alarms/changes

user opcua-server
topic read sensors/#
topic read alarms/changes

# The container healthcheck reads the broker's own statistics.
user monitor
topic read $SYS/#
